DS4 modifications: independent native C tokenizer, projection-only PLE,
bidirectional local/full attention using the existing numeric C API, ragged
batch isolation, host mean/L2 pooling and explicit resource ownership.
The pinned checkpoint supplies tokenizer/configuration data. Compilation and
Transformers oracles are development tools; no Python serving dependency.
Additional DS4 modifications: native uint8 bicubic patch preprocessing, bounded
media/cache ownership, FP32/FP64 audio feature extraction, axial vision RoPE,
position pooling and multimodal projection/insertion through opaque C APIs.
Audio additions: two subsampling convolutions, 12 Conformer blocks, blocked
relative attention, causal depthwise convolution, mask-selected audio projection
and ordered typed four-modal composition with one backbone pooling operation.
